Package: IndepAssoc
Title: Confounder-Adjusted Independent Association Testing via Propensity Score
    Methods
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Mostafa", "Hamza", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mostafa.mn.abbas@gmail.com")
Description: Generalizes a propensity-score-based analysis pipeline for
    retrospective cohort studies. Answers whether a risk factor or exposure
    is independently associated with an outcome after adjusting for
    confounders via matching, weighting, stratification, or regression.
    Provides publication-ready tables and effect estimates with minimal code.
